window.ENGLISH_SAMPLE_SMALL_ENTRIES = [
  ["01 通知/告示：介绍 + 邀请｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose your university is going to host a welcome party for new international students. Write a notice (or an announcement) in the name of the Students' Union to\n(1) briefly introduce the party, and\n(2) invite the international students to attend it.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your notice; use “The Students' Union” instead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["01 通知/告示：介绍 + 邀请｜词汇（11）", "1. attend *v.* 参加，出席\n2. schedule *v.* 为……安排时间\n3. approximately *adv.* 大约\n4. characterize *v.* 使……具有特点\n5. a variety of 各种各样的，多种的\n6. snack *n.* 点心，小吃\n7. advisable *adj.* 明智的，可取的\n8. participate *v.* 参加\n9. opportunity *n.* 机会\n10. arouse *v.* 激起，引起\n11. campus *n.*（大学）校园，校区", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["通知/告示", "**Notice/Announcement**", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["*6 月 10 日，星期五*", "*Friday, June 10*", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["很高兴得知各位留学生已经抵校。本通知/告示旨在邀请各位参加欢迎会。", "**It is so great to** hear that you, international students, have arrived at our university. This notice/announcement is **for the purpose of** inviting you to attend a welcome party.", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["首先，欢迎会定于 6 月 20 日 19:00 在学生活动中心举行，时长约 2 小时。此外，这次欢迎会的特色是活动丰富多彩，包括唱歌、跳舞、中国文化介绍和趣味比赛。当然，欢迎会上还会提供一些中国传统小吃。总之，建议你们参加这次欢迎会，它将带给你们结交新朋友的机会，激发你们对校园生活的热情，并帮助你们更好地了解中国。", "To begin with, the party **is scheduled to start** at 19:00 on June 20 in the Center of Students' Activities **and last for approximately two hours. In addition, this party is characterized by a variety of interesting activities, including** singing, dancing, Chinese culture introduction, and fun competitions. Of course, some traditional Chinese snacks will be served at the party. To conclude, **it is advisable for** you **to** participate in this party, **which will bring you** opportunities to make friends, **arouse your passion for the campus life, and help you** know China better.", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["最后，期待你们的参与。", "Finally, **we are looking forward to** your participation.", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["学生会", "**The Students' Union**\n\n（136 words）", "小作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["02 邮件：建议 + 说明｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose a foreign friend of yours has been looking for\nAI tools to enhance learning efficiency. Write him/her\nan e-mail to make a recommendation and explain your\nreasons.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li\nMing” instead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["02 邮件：建议 + 说明｜词汇（9）", "1. promote *v.* 增进，促进\n2. efficiency *n.* 效率\n3. recommendation *n.* 推荐\n4. try out 试用，试验\n5. suit one's needs 满足某人的需要\n6. a case in point 恰当例证\n7. in the end 最终\n8. excellent *adj.* 优秀的，极好的\n9. performance *n.* 表现", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["亲爱的斯凯：", "Dear Sky,", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["很高兴得知你在寻找AI工具来提高学习效率。今天我写信来是想做个推荐。", "**I am quite pleased to** hear that you are looking for AI tools to promote learning efficiency. Today, **I am writing to** make a recommendation.", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["建议你在学习中尝试几个AI工具，因为通过试用这些工具，你能够知道哪个最符合你的需求。一个典型的例子就是我自己。作为一名正在准备全国研究生入学考试的大四学生，我试过文心一言、通义和Kimi。最终，我选择了Kimi，它的特点是在信息搜集方面表现出色。这个AI工具能够让我更高效，激发我对学习的热情，并帮助我节省时间和精力。", "**It is advisable for** you **to** try out several AI tools in learning since **it is** by trying them out **that** you can know which one can best suit your needs. **A case in point is myself.** As a senior **who** is preparing for the national entrance exams for postgraduate studies, **I** tried ERNIE Bot, Tongyi, and Kimi. In the end, I chose Kimi, which is **characterized by** its excellent performance in information collection. This AI tool **can bring me** high efficiency, **inspire my passion for learning, and help me** save time and energy.", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["等你试用之后，我期待跟你探讨AI工具的更多细节。", "**I am looking forward to** discussing more details of the AI tools after you use them.", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["祝好 李明", "Best wishes, Li Ming\n\n（141 words）", "小作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["03 邮件：介绍 + 建议｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose you are a senior student. Read the following\ne-mail from a first-year student in your department\nand write a reply.\nDear Li Ming,\nI've heard that our university has launched a peer\nmentoring program for new students, but I don't know\nmuch about it. Could you give me more details?\nYours,\nMichael\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li\nMing” instead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["03 邮件：介绍 + 建议｜词汇（5）", "1. mentor *v.* 指导，培训\n2. adapt to 适应（新情况）\n3. spare *adj.* 空闲的\n4. develop *v.* 获得，形成\n5. sign up for 报名参加", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["亲爱的迈克尔：", "Dear Michael,", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["得知你对面向新生的同伴指导项目感兴趣，我十分高兴。今天我写这封信是想介绍一些相关细节。", "**I'm quite pleased to** know that you are interested in the peer mentoring program for new students. Today, **I am writing for the purpose of** introducing certain details.", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["本项目将新生与高年级学生结对，来帮助他们适应大学生活。首先，大学生活的特点是学生拥有更多空闲时间。其次，与高中相比，大学里有更加丰富多样的校园活动、社团和学生组织。因此，作为高年级学生，我们应当帮助你们形成一套新的、适合大学的学习和生活节奏。总之，建议你报名参加同伴指导项目。我相信你将会从中获益良多。", "This program pairs freshmen with seniors to help them adapt to college life. To begin with, college life **is characterized by** the fact that students have more spare time. Then, **compared with** high schools, there are a **wider** variety of campus activities, clubs and organizations in college. Thus we, **as senior students, are supposed to** help you develop a new pace of study and life suited for college. To conclude, **it's advisable for** you **to** sign up for the peer mentoring program. **I'm convinced that** you will benefit a lot from it.", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["当然，如果你还有其他问题，随时可以问我。", "Of course, if you have any other questions, please feel free to ask me.", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["谨上 李明", "Yours truly, Li Ming\n\n（140 words）", "小作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["04 邮件：感谢+邀请｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose you received much help from Prof. Thomas\nduring your summer study abroad program. Write an\ne-mail to\n(1) thank him, and\n(2) invite him to visit China.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li Ming”\ninstead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["04 邮件：感谢+邀请｜词汇（14）", "1. recall *v.* 记起，回忆起\n2. extend *v.* 提供，给予\n3. gratitude *n.* 感激之情，感谢\n4. tremendous *adj.* 巨大的，极大的\n5. fruitful *adj.* 成果丰硕的\n6. be fond of 喜欢……，爱好……\n7. architecture *n.* 建筑\n8. accordingly *adv.* 因此\n9. deem *v.* 认为\n10. in person 亲自\n11. the Summer Palace 颐和园\n12. the Forbidden City 故宫\n13. favorable *adj.* 肯定的\n14. repay *v.* 报答，回报", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["亲爱的托马斯教授：", "Dear Prof. Thomas,", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["回想起在贵国参加留学项目的那个暑假，我非常高兴。今天写信来是想表达感谢，并邀请您来中国旅行。", "**I am quite pleased to** recall the summer when I attended the study abroad program in your country. Today, **I am writing for the purpose of** extending my gratitude and inviting you to visit China.", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["首先，正是您的鼎力相助，使我得享一段舒适且获益良多的学习之旅。因此，我非常感激您的帮助。此外，我知道您很喜欢中国的古建筑。因此，我觉得您可以在闲暇时亲自参观一下长城、颐和园和故宫等。", "To begin with, **it was** your tremendous help **that enabled** me **to** enjoy a comfortable and fruitful trip of learning. Thus, **I am deeply grateful to** you **for** your help. In addition, I know that you are fond of China's ancient architecture. Accordingly, **I deem that it is advisable for** you **to** visit in person the Great Wall, the Summer Palace, the Forbidden City and so on in your spare time.", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["期待早日收到您的肯定答复，好让我报答您。", "**I am looking forward to** your favorable reply at your earliest convenience so that I can repay you.", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["谨上 李明", "Yours sincerely, Li Ming\n\n（131 words）", "小作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["05 邮件：建议+说明｜题目", "**Directions:**\nRead the following e-mail from one of your foreign\nfriends and write a reply.\nDear Li Ming,\nI'm going to participate in a speech contest on Chinese\nculture, but I haven't decided on my topic yet. Could you\ngive me some advice? Maybe we could arrange a time to\ndiscuss it over a video call. Looking forward to your reply!\nYours,\nJane\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li Ming”\ninstead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["05 邮件：建议+说明｜词汇（4）", "1. contest *n.* 比赛\n2. time-honored *adj.* 历史悠久的\n3. distinctive *adj.* 独特的\n4. available *adj.* 有空的", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["亲爱的简：", "Dear Jane,", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["很高兴得知你打算参加关于中国文化的演讲比赛。我写信来是想推荐一个主题。", "**So glad to** hear that you are going to participate in a speech contest on Chinese culture. **I am writing to** suggest a topic.", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["首先，我建议你选择中国古代建筑作为演讲主题，因为中国的特点是历史悠久，而且我知道你很喜欢中国的古代建筑。此外，你可以去参观一下长城、颐和园和故宫，这将会带给你独特的体验，唤起你对中国文化的热情，并帮助你为比赛做好充分的准备。", "To begin with, **it is advisable for** you **to** choose China's ancient architecture as your topic since China is **characterized by** its time-honored history and I know that you are fond of China's ancient buildings. In addition, you **are supposed to** visit the Great Wall, the Summer Palace, and the Forbidden City, which **will bring you** distinctive experience, **arouse your passion for** Chinese culture, **and help you** prepare fully for the contest.", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["最后，如果你有任何问题，可以给我打电话，我每周五早上都有空。", "Finally, if you have any other questions, please call me and I will be available every Friday morning.", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["祝好 李明", "Best wishes, Li Ming\n\n（120 words）", "小作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["06 邮件：道歉+建议｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose your foreign friend James is coming to China\nthis Saturday. You originally planned to pick him up at the\nairport, but could not make it now. Write him an e-mail to\n(1) make an apology, and\n(2) propose a solution.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li Ming”\ninstead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["06 邮件：道歉+建议｜词汇（6）", "1. originally *adv.* 原来，起初\n2. apology *n.* 道歉\n3. exceedingly *adv.* 非常\n4. allocate *v.* 分配……（给）\n5. due to 因为，由于\n6. option *n.* 可选择的事物，选择", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["亲爱的詹姆斯：", "Dear James,", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["很高兴得知你将来中国，我原本计划去机场接你。但是，我写信来是想道歉，因为我恐怕去不了了。", "**I am quite pleased to** hear that you are coming to China and I originally planned to pick you up at the airport. However, **I am writing for the purpose of** making an apology since I am afraid I can't make it.", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["你知道我过去半年特别忙，因为我几乎把所有时间和精力都用在了准备全国研究生入学考试上，这个考试对我来说非常重要。而且，由于我的粗心，直到两分钟前我才意识到考试当天就是你抵达中国的那天。因此，我别无选择，只能请我最好的朋友斯凯本周六去机场接你。", "You know that during the past half year, **I have been exceedingly busy because I allocated nearly all my time and energy for** preparing for the national entrance exams for postgraduate studies, which is of great significance to me. Then, due to my carelessness, I did not notice that the date of the test is the day when you will arrive in China until two minutes ago. Accordingly, I have no option but to ask my best friend, Sky, to pick you up at the airport this Saturday.", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["真的很抱歉。等考完试以后，我计划带你在北京四处逛逛。", "**I am deeply sorry** and I plan to show you around Beijing after the test.", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["祝好 李明", "Best wishes, Li Ming\n\n（151 words）", "小作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["07 邮件：申请+说明｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose you are to write an e-mail applying for a\nvolunteer position at the Center of Cultural Interchange.\nWrite an e-mail to the organization to\n(1) express your intention, and\n(2) show why you are qualified.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li Ming”\ninstead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["07 邮件：申请+说明｜词汇（11）", "1. volunteer *n.* 志愿者\n2. convinced *adj.* 确信的\n3. qualified *adj.* 有资格的\n4. devote ... to ... 把……用于……\n5. accumulate *v.* 积累\n6. adequate *adj.* 足够的\n7. possess *v.* 拥有\n8. serve *v.* 担任（职务）\n9. international conference 国际会议\n10. do one's utmost 尽最大努力\n11. fulfill *v.* 履行", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["尊敬的先生/女士：", "Dear Sir/Madam,", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["作为北京大学的一名大四学生，我对文化交流非常感兴趣，写信来是为了申请贵中心的志愿者岗位。", "**As a senior student at Peking University who** is quite interested in cultural communication, **I am writing for the purpose of** applying for the volunteer position at your center.", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["我坚信我可以胜任这个岗位，原因有两个。首先，在大学期间，我几乎把所有时间和精力都投入我的专业“跨文化交流”中。正是努力学习使我积累了足够的专业知识和技能。此外，与其他人相比，我与外国人交流的经验更丰富，因为我曾担任过数场国际会议的志愿者。", "**I am convinced that** I am qualified for this position for two reasons. To begin with, during my college years, **I have devoted nearly all my time and energy to my** major, Cross-cultural Exchange. **It was my hard work that enabled me to** accumulate adequate professional knowledge and skills. In addition, **compared with** others, I possess **richer** experience in communicating with foreigners, since I have served as a volunteer for several international conferences.", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["如果我有幸成为贵中心的志愿者，我将尽最大努力履行我的职责。", "If I am lucky enough to be a volunteer for your center, **I will do my utmost to** fulfill my duties.", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["谨上 李明", "Yours sincerely, Li Ming\n\n（129 words）", "小作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["08 邮件：感谢+建议｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose you have just taken part in a one-day career\nexploration program organized by your university's Career\nCenter. Write an e-mail to the program coordinators to\n(1) express your thanks,\n(2) briefly describe what you learned from the program, and\n(3) make one suggestion for future programs.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li\nMing” instead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["08 邮件：感谢+建议｜词汇（5）", "1. broaden one's horizons 开阔眼界\n2. theoretical knowledge 理论知识\n3. requirement *n.* [常用复数] 所需的（或所要的）东西\n4. duration *n.* 持续时间\n5. sufficient *adj.* 足够的，充足的", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["尊敬的先生/女士：", "Dear Sir/Madam,", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["回想起您组织的一日职业探索项目，我十分激动。今天我写这封信，是为了向您表达感谢，并提出一条建议。", "**So excited to** recall the one-day career exploration program organized by you. Today, **I am writing to** express my thanks and make one suggestion.", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["该项目确实帮助我们开阔了视野，激发了我们探索未来职业道路的热情，并为我们提供了一个将理论知识运用于实践的机会。因此，我们非常感谢您出色的组织工作。然而，相较于学生的实际需求，该项目的持续时间与探索深度都尚有不足。所以，建议我校就业指导中心组织更多为期两天或更长时间的项目，以此促进我们的职业探索。", "This program did **help us** broaden our horizons, **inspire our passion for** exploring future career paths, **and provide us** with an opportunity to put theoretical knowledge into practice. Thus, **we are quite grateful to** you **for** your excellent organization. However, **compared with** students' practical requirements, the duration and depth of the program were **not sufficient**. Therefore, **it is advisable for** our university's Career Center **to** organize more programs lasting two days or longer to further our career exploration.", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["最后，我坚信，在您的支持下，学生将会从未来的项目中获得更多益处。", "Finally, **I am convinced that** with your support, students will benefit more from future programs.", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["祝好 李明", "Best wishes, Li Ming\n\n（124 words）", "小作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["09 邮件：建议+鼓励｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose your friend Jack did not do well in his maths\nmidterm exam. He wrote you an e-mail asking for\nadvice. Write him a reply to\n(1) give your advice, and\n(2) encourage him.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your e-mail; use “Li Ming”\ninstead. (10 points)\n### 范文背诵", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["09 邮件：建议+鼓励｜词汇（6）", "1. midterm *adj.* 学期中间的，期中的\n2. in advance 预先，事先\n3. necessity *n.* 必要，需要\n4. summarize *v.* 总结\n5. error *n.* 错误，差错\n6. derive from 起源于，来自", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["亲爱的杰克：", "Dear Jack,", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["很遗憾得知最近的数学期中考试你没考好。今天，我写信来是想分享一些我的建议并给你一些鼓励。", "**I am deeply sorry to** hear that you did not do well in your recent maths midterm exam. Today, **I am writing for the purpose of** sharing my suggestions and encouraging you.", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["首先，建议你提前准备，因为正是充分的准备使你能够积累足够的知识和考试技巧。一个典型的例子就是我自己。与其他人相比，我不算聪明，但充分的准备能够带给我自信，唤起我对学习的热情，并帮助我在数学考试中获得成功。此外，你还有必要总结自己的错误，因为失败是成功之母。", "To begin with, **it is advisable for** you **to** prepare in advance since **it is** full preparation **that enables you to** accumulate adequate knowledge and skills for the test. **A case in point is myself.** **Compared with** others, I am **not smarter**, but full preparation **can bring me** confidence, **arouse my passion for learning, and help me** succeed in maths tests. In addition, **it is of great necessity for** you **to** summarize your errors as success derives from failure.", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["总之，我坚信，你如果竭尽全力提前准备和练习，下次会考得更好。", "To conclude, **I am convinced that if you do your utmost to** prepare and practice in advance, you will do better in the next exam.", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["祝好 李明", "Best wishes, Li Ming\n\n（142 words）", "小作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["10 会议纪要（新大纲）｜题目", "**Directions:**\nSuppose your class held a meeting to discuss how\nto prevent food waste in daily life. Please write the\nminutes for the meeting. Your minutes should include\n(1) basic information about the discussion, and\n(2) issues and solutions raised in the discussion.\nWrite your answer in about 100 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET.\n**Do not** use your own name in your minutes; use “Li\nMing” instead. (10 points)", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 会议纪要（新大纲）｜题目解读", "纪要一般指会议纪要，是2027年大纲中提到的小作文考查形式之一。在写作时，一定要先看清题目要求写哪些内容。通常情况下，一篇纪要需要包含会议的基本信息，如时间、地点、参会人员、会议主题、会议内容等，会议内容可能涉及会议各环节做了什么、最终得出什么结论等。\n\n这种题型看上去很新，但实际上在写作时，仍旧可以大量运用功能句。如果考试考到了，大家也不用担心，只需审好题，并参考下面范文的思路写作即可。", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 会议纪要（新大纲）｜词汇（9）", "1. minute *n.* [~s] 会议记录\n2. participant *n.* 参加者\n3. come to a conclusion 得出结论\n4. raise *v.* 提起，提出\n5. cherish *v.* 珍惜\n6. phenomenon *n.* 现象\n7. like *n.* 类似的人（或物）\n8. immediate *adj.* 立刻的\n9. leftover *n.* [常用复数] 吃剩的饭菜", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["会议纪要", "Minutes", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["本次会议旨在讨论如何在日常生活中避免食物浪费，最终所有与会人员得出一致结论。", "This meeting **was for the purpose of** discussing how to prevent food waste in everyday life and finally all participants came to the same conclusion.", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["会议于 6 月 20 日 14:00 在 201 教室举行，持续时长为 2 小时。斯凯教授提出了这一问题，并指出，与过去相比，我们的生活更加富裕，于是越来越多的年轻人不珍惜食物。接着，全班同学一致同意这一现象非常值得关注。大家认为，我们不仅很有必要杜绝食物浪费，还要避免浪费时间、电、水以及其他类似资源。", "The meeting **began** at 14:00 on June 20 in Classroom 201 **and lasted for** two hours. Professor Sky raised the question and pointed out that **compared to** the past years, we enjoy a **richer** life and thus an increasing number of youngsters do not cherish food. Then, all classmates agreed that this phenomenon **is particularly worth attention**. **We deemed that it is of great necessity for** us **to** stop wasting not only food, but also time, electricity, water, and the like.", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["结论是，我们应该立刻采取行动来避免日常生活中的食物浪费，例如只买需要的，以及不扔掉剩饭剩菜。", "The conclusion is that we **are supposed to** take immediate actions to prevent food waste in daily life, **such as** only buying what we need and not throwing away leftovers.", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["记录人：李明", "Minutes recorder: Li Ming\n\n（141 words）", "小作文 · Topic 10"],
];

window.ENGLISH_SAMPLE_BIG_ENTRIES = [
  ["大作文章节导语", "2024年考研英语（一）大作文第一次考查了“图画+图表”作文，2025年又第一次考查了图表作文。结合真题的这一考查趋势以及最新的大纲，本章预测了2篇图表作文、2篇“图画+图表”作文、5篇图画作文和1篇材料作文。所有范文都使用功能句写成，便于大家背诵和模仿写作。掌握了本章内容，无论考研英语（一）大作文怎么考，相信大家都能从容应对。", "大作文 · 章导语"],
  ["01 图表：燃油车与新能源汽车国内销量｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the table below. In your essay,\nyou should\n(1) describe the table briefly,\n(2) interpret the table, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n2025年上半年燃油车和新能源汽车国内销量变化\n（单位：百万辆）\n| 车型／月份 | 1月 | 2月 | 3月 | 4月 | 5月 | 6月 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 燃油车 | 1.05 | 1.16 | 1.33 | 1.04 | 1.04 | 1.18 |\n| 新能源汽车 | 0.79 | 0.89 | 1.07 | 1.02 | 1.09 | 1.12 |", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["01 图表：燃油车与新能源汽车国内销量｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图表+数据上升+数据稳定+值得注意\n**中间段（4~6句话）**\n图表联系主旨+引出原因+原因1+原因2\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n建议1+建议2+举例", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["01 图表：燃油车与新能源汽车国内销量｜词汇（22）", "1. illustrate *v.* 说明，解释\n2. domestic *adj.* 本国的，国内的\n3. gasoline *n.* 汽油\n4. vehicle *n.* 车辆\n5. fluctuate *v.* 波动\n6. noteworthy *adj.* 值得注意的\n7. surpass *v.* 超过，胜过\n8. statistics *n.* 统计数字\n9. apparently *adv.* 显然\n10. associate *v.* 联想，联系\n11. fierce *adj.* 激烈的\n12. boom *n.* 繁荣\n13. prosperity *n.* 兴旺，繁荣\n14. a host of 许多，大量\n15. additional *adj.* 额外的\n16. eco-friendly *adj.* 生态友好的，对环境无害的\n17. maintenance *n.* 保养\n18. manufacturer *n.* 生产商\n19. potential *n.* 潜力\n20. comprehensive *adj.* 综合的\n21. strategy *n.* 策略\n22. solar-powered *adj.* 太阳能驱动的", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["这是一张表格，清晰展示了 2025 年上半年中国燃油车和新能源汽车国内销量的变化。在此期间，新能源汽车的销量稳步上升，从1月的79万辆增加到6月的112万辆。相比之下，燃油车的销量在110万辆上下波动。尤其值得注意的是，新能源汽车的销量在5月份超过了燃油车。", "**This is a table, clearly illustrating the changes in the** domestic sales of gasoline-powered and new-energy vehicles in China during the first half of 2025. **In this period,** the sales of new-energy cars **increased steadily, from** 0.79 million in January to 1.12 million in June. By contrast, the sales of gasoline cars **fluctuated around** 1.1 million. **It is particularly noteworthy that** the sales of new-energy vehicles surpassed those of gasoline-powered vehicles in May.", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["显然，这样的数据能让人联想到新能源汽车和传统汽车之间的激烈竞争。那么，出现上述现象的原因是什么？一方面，近年来，中国的典型特征在于其经济的繁荣发展，这使得很多家庭有了额外的收入来购买燃油车或新能源汽车。另一方面，与传统汽车相比，新能源汽车更加便宜、环保、高效，需要的保养也更少。因此，越来越多的人选择了新能源汽车。", "**Such statistics, apparently, can be associated with** the fierce competition between new-energy vehicles and traditional cars. **Then, what resulted in the phenomenon above?** **For one thing,** in recent years, China **has been characterized by** its boom and prosperity in economy, **which has enabled** a host of families **to** possess additional income to purchase gasoline-powered or new-energy cars. **For another, compared with** traditional cars, new-energy vehicles are **much cheaper, more eco-friendly, more efficient** and require **less** maintenance. **Thus,** an increasing number of people have chosen new-energy cars.", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["在我看来，中国的汽车制造商应该更关注新能源汽车市场，因为其潜力巨大。同时，他们还应制定综合策略来开发更多种类的新能源汽车，比如太阳能汽车。", "**To my understanding,** China's car manufacturers **are supposed to pay more attention to the** new-energy car market **due to** its huge potential. **Meanwhile, it is advisable** **for them to work out comprehensive strategies to develop** more types of new-energy vehicles, **such as** solar-powered cars. (203 words)", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["01 图表：燃油车与新能源汽车国内销量｜相关表达（7）", "1. 机动车尾气排放　vehicle exhaust emission\n2. 开发可再生资源　develop renewable resources\n3. 提升环保意识　raise environmental awareness\n4. 学会减排、重复使用、循环利用　learn to reduce, reuse and recycle\n5. 鼓励使用公共交通工具　encourage the use of public transport\n6. 促进可持续发展　promote sustainable development\n7. 节约用水　conserve water", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["电动汽车产生的污染比燃油车少，因此成为环保人士的理想选择。", "Electric vehicles create less pollution than cars that run on gasoline, making them a desirable alternative for those concerned about environmental protection.", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["为环保尽微薄之力，也好过袖手旁观。", "A little effort towards saving the environment is better than no effort.", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["想拥有一个安全放心的未来和优美的居住环境，保护环境至关重要。", "Environmental protection is the key to a safe and secure future with a beautiful environment to live in.", "大作文 · Topic 01"],
  ["02 图表：在职群体参加继续学习的目的｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the chart below. In your essay,\nyou should\n(1) describe the chart briefly,\n(2) interpret the chart, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕条形图：提升现有岗位技能65%、学习新领域知识48%、发展个人兴趣37%、获得文凭或职业证书26%；横轴0～80%。", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["02 图表：在职群体参加继续学习的目的｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图表+比例排序\n**中间段（4~6句话）**\n图表联系主旨+值得关注+原因1+原因2\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n个人观点+积极意义", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["02 图表：在职群体参加继续学习的目的｜词汇（14）", "1. bar chart 条形图\n2. striking *adj.* 显著的，异乎寻常的\n3. further study 继续学习，进修\n4. enhance *v.* 提高，增强\n5. acquire *v.* 获得，学到\n6. diploma *n.* 毕业文凭\n7. vocational *adj.* 职业的，职业技术的\n8. certificate *n.* 合格证书，文凭\n9. contemporary *adj.* 当代的，现代的\n10. transform *v.* 使改变外观（或性质）\n11. deficiency *n.* 不足，缺少\n12. academic qualification [常用复数]学历，学术资历\n13. competitive *adj.* 竞争的\n14. edge *n.*（微弱的）优势", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["这是一幅条形图，它清楚地展示了 2025 年某市在职群体在继续学习目的方面的显著差异。具体来看，提升现有岗位技能位居第一，占 65%。其次是学习新领域知识，占 48%。发展个人兴趣紧随其后，占 37%。最后是获得文凭或职业证书，占 26%。", "**Presented is a bar chart, which clearly illustrates the striking contrasts in** employed people's purposes for further study in a certain city in 2025. To be specific, enhancing current job skills **ranked first, accounting for** 65%. **The next was** acquiring knowledge in new areas, **at** 48%, **followed by** developing personal interests **at** 37%. **Finally came** gaining diplomas or vocational certificates, **at** 26%.", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["这样的数据无疑可以让人联想到，人们在工作后继续学习的重要性正与日俱增。首先，当代社会的特点是竞争激烈与科技的迅速发展。这种现象尤其值得关注，因为正是技术的快速发展，使人们为了适应岗位要求而不得不持续学习。一个典型的例子就是人工智能，它正在改变众多领域。此外，与过去相比，如今的在职者拥有更好的经济条件，可以追求自己的兴趣爱好，或者弥补学历方面的不足。", "**Such statistics, definitely, can be associated with** the growing significance of continuing to learn after starting one's career. To begin with, contemporary society **is characterized by** fierce competition and rapid technological advances. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention for the reason that it is** the rapid development of technology **that causes** people **to** have no option but to keep learning for the purpose of adapting to job requirements. **A case in point is** AI, as it is transforming many fields. In addition, **compared to** the past, employed people today possess **better** financial conditions to pursue their interests or make up for deficiencies in academic qualifications.", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["总而言之，我认为每个人都有必要培养终身学习的习惯和意识。终身学习能够给我们带来竞争优势，激发我们奋斗的热情，并帮助我们抓住机遇。", "In the final analysis, **I am convinced that it is advisable for** everyone **to** develop the habit and awareness of lifelong learning, which **can give us** a competitive edge, **inspire our passion for** striving, **and help us** seize opportunities. (206 words)", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["02 图表：在职群体参加继续学习的目的｜相关表达（9）", "1. 继续学习　continuing education; further study\n2. 终身学习　lifelong learning\n3. 在职人员　working adults; employed people\n4. 职业发展　career/vocational development\n5. 技能提升　upskilling\n6. 学历　academic qualifications; educational background\n7. 适应岗位要求　adapt to job requirements\n8. 保持竞争优势　maintain a competitive edge\n9. 平衡工作与学习　balance work and study", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["技能提升是一项长期投资，能够丰富知识、强化技能和提升能力，这些有助于员工推动自身发展职业。", "Upskilling is a longer-term investment in augmenting the knowledge, skills, and competence that help employees advance their careers.", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["我们的学习能力正在成为我们在职业生涯中赖以立足的重要资本。", "Our capacity for learning is becoming the important currency we trade on in our careers.", "大作文 · Topic 02"],
  ["03 图画+图表：公共场所无障碍通道的普及｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the picture and the chart below.\nIn your essay, you should\n(1) describe the picture and the chart briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕公共建筑入口前有数级台阶，右侧一道带扶手的坡道，一名轮椅使用者正沿坡道上行。\n〔图〕柱状图：2021年56%、2022年64%、2023年71%、2024年79%、2025年85%；纵轴0～100%，每格20%。\n注：无障碍通道指坡道、升降设施或其他便于行动不便者进出的通道。\n2021~2025年某市公共场所设置无障碍通道的比例", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["03 图画+图表：公共场所无障碍通道的普及｜题目解读", "2024年考研英语（一）大作文采用了“图画+图表”的形式，题目给出一张图画和一张图表，要求考生简述图画、图表内容并提出见解。这是考研英语（一）第一次采用这种形式，看似复杂，却也在考纲描述的范围之内。根据考试大纲，英语（一）大作文提供信息的形式包含文字、图画、图表等。遇到此类作文题时，大家不必担心，只要利用本书范文展示的功能句写作，就可以事半功倍。\n\n写作时，在首段先对图画细节进行描述，然后概述图表的主要内容及显著特征，比如占比大小、增减趋势等。在中间段，结合图画及图表内容联系主旨，或简要分析导致这种现象或趋势的原因，或阐述其积极意义，也可举例说明。最后在尾段进行总结，表达个人观点，提出建议或发出号召。相关功能句可参考后面的范文。", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["03 图画+图表：公共场所无障碍通道的普及｜结构", "**首段（2~4句话）**\n图画细节+概述图表+数据上升\n**中间段（4~6句话）**\n“图画+图表”联系主旨+典型特征+值得关注+原因+举例+个人观点+意义\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n个人观点+号召", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["03 图画+图表：公共场所无障碍通道的普及｜词汇（15）", "1. disabled *adj.* 丧失能力的，有残疾的\n2. wheelchair *n.* 轮椅\n3. accessible *adj.* 可到达（或进入、使用）的\n4. pathway *n.* 道路，路径\n5. proportion *n.* 比例\n6. remarkably *adv.* 显著地\n7. harmonious *adj.* 和谐的\n8. financial budget 财政预算\n9. mobility *n.* 移动的能力，易于行走的能力\n10. independently *adv.* 独立地\n11. expectant mother 孕妇，准妈妈\n12. liken ... to ... 将……比作……\n13. civilized *adj.* 文明的，开化的\n14. foster *v.* 促进，培养\n15. atmosphere *n.* 气氛，氛围", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["左图展示了一个简单却十分温暖的场景：一位残障人士正在无障碍通道上轻松地使用轮椅移动。与此同时，右图清楚地显示，在某市，从2021年到2025年，配备无障碍通道的公共场所的比例显著上升，从56%提高到了85%。", "The left drawing shows a simple but quite warm scene, in which **there is** a disabled person, **using** a wheelchair to move easily along an accessible pathway. Meanwhile, the right chart clearly illustrates that in a certain city, **from** 2021 **to** 2025, **the proportion of** public places equipped with accessible pathways **increased remarkably, from** 56% **to** 85%.", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["显然，上述场景和数据能让人联想到和谐社会中对残障人士的特殊关爱。毫无疑问，近年来，中国的特点在于其经济繁荣昌盛，这使政府能够投入更多财政预算，用在包括无障碍通道在内的公共设施上。这一现象尤其值得关注，因为正是这些设施让行动不便的人获得巨大便利，能够独立出行。另一个典型例子是，很多公交车上都设有老幼病残孕专座。在我看来，这种特殊关爱可以比作阳光，它能给有需要的人带来温暖，激发他们对生活的热情，并帮助我们建设文明社会。", "**The scene and statistics above, apparently, can be associated with** the special care for people with disabilities in a harmonious society. Undoubtedly, in recent years, China **has been characterized by** its economic boom and prosperity, **which has enabled** the government **to** devote more financial budgets to public facilities, including accessible pathways. **This phenomenon is particularly worth attention for the reason that it is** these facilities **that enable** people with limited mobility **to** enjoy tremendous convenience and get around independently. **Another case in point is that** on many buses, there are seats reserved for the elderly, children, the sick, people with disabilities, and expectant mothers. **To my mind,** this special care **can be likened to** sunshine, which **can bring** warmth to those in need, **inspire their passion for life, and help us** build a civilized society.", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["总而言之，我认为全社会都应营造积极氛围，去关心、关爱并保护残障人士以及其他同类群体。", "In the final analysis, **I deem that society as a whole is supposed to foster a positive atmosphere to care for, love,** and protect those with disabilities and the like. (222 words)", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["03 图画+图表：公共场所无障碍通道的普及｜相关表达（10）", "1. 无障碍通道　accessible pathway; barrier-free access\n2. 残障人士　people with disabilities; disabled people\n3. 公共设施　public facilities\n4. 基础设施　infrastructure\n5. 设施建设/使用规范　standards for facility construction/usage\n6. 消除出行障碍　remove barriers to mobility\n7. 平等参与社会生活　participate in society on an equal basis\n8. 特殊关爱　special care\n9. 包容的社会氛围　an inclusive social atmosphere\n10. 构建和谐社会　build a harmonious society", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["城市会从无障碍建设中受益，因为包容的环境能够促进社会和谐与文明。", "Cities benefit from accessibility, because inclusive environments boost social harmony and civilization.", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["一个和谐的社会应当保障弱势群体的福祉，而不是忽视弱者、淘汰弱者。", "A harmonious society ought to safeguard the well-being of vulnerable groups, instead of overlooking or casting them aside.", "大作文 · Topic 03"],
  ["04 图画+图表：急救知识的普及｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the picture and the chart below.\nIn your essay, you should\n(1) describe the picture and the chart briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕一名穿白大褂、挂听诊器的女医生俯身握住两名年轻女子的手，三人围在急救训练模型前示范按压。\n〔图〕折线图：2021年9%、2022年14%、2023年19%、2024年25%、2025年32%；纵轴0～50%，每格10%。\n2021~2025年某市18~60岁居民参加过急救培训的比例", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["04 图画+图表：急救知识的普及｜结构", "**首段（2~4句话）**\n图画细节+概述图表+数据上升\n**中间段（4~6句话）**\n“图画+图表”联系主旨+典型特征+值得关注+原因+举例\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n个人观点+号召", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["04 图画+图表：急救知识的普及｜词汇（12）", "1. healthcare worker 医护人员\n2. impart *v.* 传授，通知\n3. first aid 急救\n4. ascend *v.* 上升\n5. public awareness 公众意识\n6. regarding *prep.* 关于，至于\n7. emergency *n.* 紧急情况\n8. cardiac *adj.* 心脏的\n9. arrest *n.* 停止，中止\n10. in a nutshell 简而言之\n11. all walks of life 各行各业\n12. vital *adj.* 至关重要的", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["左图中，一名专业医护人员正在向两名年轻人传授急救知识。与此同时，右图清楚地显示，从2021年到2025年，某市18~60岁居民中参加过急救课程的比例显著上升，从9%提高到了32%。", "In the left drawing, **there is** a professional healthcare worker, **imparting** first aid knowledge to two youngsters. Meanwhile, the right chart clearly illustrates that **from** 2021 **to** 2025, in a certain city, **the proportion of** residents aged 18 to 60 who attended first aid courses **ascended significantly, from** 9% **to** 32%.", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["显然，上述场景和数据能让人联想到公众在安全与健康意识方面的积极转变。毫无疑问，近几十年来，中国的特点是经济繁荣和科技进步，这使人们能够享受更高质量的生活，并有更多机会获取包括急救技能在内的各种知识。这一现象尤其值得关注，因为掌握基础急救技能能够使居民在心脏骤停、意外事故等紧急情况下挽救自己或他人的生命。我就是一个典型的例子。作为年轻人，我喜欢观看健康教育视频和电视节目，也喜欢参加医学讲座，以学习急救知识。多亏了那些知识，我曾在一次车祸后救助了一名伤者。", "**The scene and statistics above, definitely, can be associated with** a positive shift in public awareness regarding safety and health. Undoubtedly, in recent decades, China **has been characterized by** its economic prosperity and technological advancement, **which have enabled** people to enjoy a higher quality of life and have more opportunities to acquire various kinds of knowledge, **including** first aid skills. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention for the reason that it is** mastering basic first aid skills **that enables** citizens **to** save their own or others' lives in emergencies, **such as** cardiac arrests, accidents and the like. I am **a case in point. As a** youngster, **I prefer** watching health education videos and TV programs, as well as attending medical lectures for the purpose of acquiring first aid knowledge. Thanks to such knowledge, I helped save an injured man after a car accident.", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["总而言之，我认为医院应该向各行各业的人提供更多免费培训课程。同时，整个社会也应营造积极的氛围，鼓励公众学习这些至关重要的技能。", "In a nutshell, **I am convinced that it is advisable for** hospitals **to** offer more free training courses to people from all walks of life. Meanwhile, **society as a whole should foster a positive atmosphere to** inspire the public to learn these vital skills. (238 words)", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["04 图画+图表：急救知识的普及｜相关表达（10）", "1. 急救知识　first aid knowledge\n2. 急救措施　first aid measures\n3. 在紧急情况下　in an emergency\n4. 应急反应技能　emergency response skills\n5. 普及卫生教育　promote hygiene education\n6. 公众的安全健康意识　public awareness of/regarding safety and health\n7. 健康素养　health literacy\n8. 心脏骤停　cardiac arrests\n9. 提供免费培训课程　offer free training courses\n10. 营造重视健康的社会氛围　foster a social atmosphere that values health", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["缺乏信心和训练可能让围观群众在分秒必争的时刻不敢施救。", "A lack of confidence and training can stop bystanders from helping when every minute matters.", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["普及急救措施教育能够提高意外事故伤者的存活率。", "Public education on first aid measures can improve the survival rates of accident victims.", "大作文 · Topic 04"],
  ["05 图画：人工智能工具的使用｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the picture below. In your essay,\nyou should\n(1) describe the picture briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕一名少年坐在笔记本电脑前，屏幕显示“答案已生成”，他心想“AI太好用了！”，图下文字：作业“已完成”。", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["05 图画：人工智能工具的使用｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图画+图画细节1+图画细节2\n**中间段（4~8句话）**\n图画联系主旨+普遍现象+值得关注+原因1+原因2+举例+危害\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n个人观点+建议", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["05 图画：人工智能工具的使用｜词汇（14）", "1. enlightening *adj.* 启迪的，有启发性的\n2. generate *v.* 产生，引起\n3. assignment *n.* 作业，任务\n4. scenario *n.*（艺术或文学作品中）场景\n5. rely on 依赖，依靠\n6. instantly *adv.* 立即，马上\n7. over-reliance *n.* 过度依赖\n8. critically *adv.* 批判性地\n9. encounter *v.* 遭遇，遇到\n10. constitute *v.* 构成，组成\n11. obstacle *n.* 障碍，阻碍\n12. hinder *v.* 阻碍，妨碍\n13. collaborative *adj.* 合作的，协作的\n14. replacement *n.* 替代品，替换品", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["这是一幅简单但颇具启发性的图画。画中，一个年轻人坐在电脑前，用人工智能生成答案，脑中还想着：“AI太好用了！”他直接点击鼠标，想要复制答案来完成作业。最后，我们能注意到图画下方有几个汉字，写的是“作业‘已完成’”。", "**This is a simple but quite enlightening drawing,** in which a youngster sits in front of a computer, **using** AI to generate an answer, **with** a thought in his mind, “AI is so handy!” He directly clicks the mouse to copy the answer to finish his assignment. **Finally, several Chinese characters can be noticed below the picture,** which say “the assignment ‘has been finished’”.", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["显然，这样的场景能让人联想到我们现实生活、工作和学习中人工智能带来的积极与消极影响。不可否认，在当代社会，越来越多的年轻人倾向于依赖人工智能迅速完成各项任务。这种现象尤其值得关注，因为许多人只关注人工智能的高效和快速生成的解决方案，却忽视了潜在风险。正是对人工智能的过度依赖，使一些使用者懒于进行批判性、独立性或创造性思考。我的朋友斯凯就是一个典型的例子。作为一名正在准备全国研究生入学考试的大四学生，在遇到学业问题时，他只会求助人工智能，复制生成好的答案。然而，在参加模拟考试时，他却无法独立解决这些问题。很遗憾，他对人工智能的依赖已经构成了一种障碍，阻碍了其学业的长期进步。", "**Such a scenario, definitely, can be associated with** the positive and negative effects of AI upon our life, work and learning in reality. **Admittedly, in contemporary society, an increasing number of young people** tend to rely on AI to complete assignments instantly. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention for the reason that** so many individuals **just focus on** AI’s efficiency and quick solutions, **ignoring** the potential risks. **It is over-reliance on AI that causes** some users **to** be too lazy to think critically, independently or creatively. My friend, Sky, **is a case in point.** As a senior **who** is preparing for the national entrance exams for postgraduate studies, **he** merely turns to AI and copies the generated answers when encountering academic problems. However, when he is taking a model test, he fails to deal with these problems independently. Unfortunately, his reliance on AI **has constituted an obstacle that hinders** his long-term academic progress.", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["因此，人工智能可以比作一把双刃剑。我们应当把人工智能视为协作伙伴，而不是用它替代人的努力。", "**Thus, AI can be likened to** a double-edged sword. **It is advisable for** us **to** view AI as a collaborative partner rather than a replacement for human efforts. (245 words)", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["05 图画：人工智能工具的使用｜相关表达（10）", "1. 人工智能工具　AI/AI-powered tools\n2. 生成答案　generate answers\n3. 提高学习效率　improve/enhance learning efficiency\n4. 提供快速解决方案　offer quick solutions\n5. 对人工智能过度依赖　over-reliance on AI\n6. 独立地/批判性地/创造性地思考　think independently/critically/creatively\n7. 判断信息是否可靠　judge whether information is reliable\n8. 把人工智能视为协作伙伴　view AI as a collaborative partner\n9. 一把双刃剑　a double-edged sword\n10. 合理使用现代科技工具　use modern technological tools rationally", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["人工智能在辅助教与学方面具有巨大潜力，但绝不应取代人的思考和努力。", "AI has great potential to support teaching and learning, but it should never replace human thinking and hard work.", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["学生过度依赖人工智能工具，可能会削弱其独立思考能力。", "Students’ over-reliance on AI tools may weaken their ability to think independently.", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["我们的任务不是抵制人工智能，而是教会学生如何批判性地使用它。", "Our task is not to resist AI, but to teach students how to use it critically.", "大作文 · Topic 05"],
  ["06 图画：“陪着”不等于“陪伴”｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the picture below. In your essay,\nyou should\n(1) describe the picture briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕父亲坐在长椅上低头看手机，儿子坐在旁边拉他手臂发问：“爸爸，你在听我说话吗？”，图下文字：“陪着”不等于“陪伴”。", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["06 图画：“陪着”不等于“陪伴”｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图画+图画细节1+图画细节2+文字说明\n**中间段（4~8句话）**\n图画联系主旨+现实情况+值得关注+原因+危害\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n个人观点+建议+积极意义", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["06 图画：“陪着”不等于“陪伴”｜词汇（8）", "1. satirical *adj.* 讽刺的\n2. smartphone *n.* 智能手机\n3. stare *v.* 盯着看\n4. perplexity *n.* 困惑，茫然\n5. accompany *v.* 陪同，陪伴\n6. admittedly *adv.* 诚然，无可否认\n7. ignore *v.* 忽视\n8. indifference *n.* 漠不关心", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["这是一幅简单但具有讽刺性的漫画，漫画中有一位父亲，手里拿着智能手机，悠闲地坐在沙发上，盯着手机屏幕。他的儿子坐在旁边，一脸困惑地问：“爸爸，你在听我说话吗？”最后，我们能注意到图画下方有几个汉字，写的是“‘陪着’不等于‘陪伴’”。", "**This is a simple but satirical cartoon, in which there is a father, with** a smartphone in his hands, **sitting** leisurely on a sofa and **staring** at the screen. **Beside him sits** his son, **with** perplexity on his face, **asking,** “Dad, are you listening to me?” **Finally, several Chinese characters can be noticed below the picture, which say that** staying together does not equal accompanying.", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["显然，这样的场景能让人联想到一些父母对待孩子的消极态度。的确，在现实生活中，很多父母仅仅是和孩子待在一起，他们几乎把所有时间都花在手机上，并不关心孩子说什么。这种现象非常值得关注，因为这些父母只关心自身的舒适和快乐，却忽视了和孩子沟通的重要性。不幸的是，这些父母的冷漠已经构成了一种障碍，阻碍亲子关系和孩子的成长。", "**Such a scenario, apparently, can be associated with** some parents’ negative attitudes towards their children. **Admittedly, in reality, a host of fathers or mothers** merely stay together with their kids, spending nearly all time on cell phones and not caring about what their children say. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention for the reason that** these parents **focus only on** their own comfort and enjoyment, **ignoring** the significance of communicating with their children. Unfortunately, these parents’ indifference **has constituted an obstacle that hinders** the parent-child relationship and their children’s growth.", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["简而言之，作为一个年轻人，我认为父母应该陪伴孩子并多与他们交流，这会带给孩子温暖，激发他们对生活的热爱，并帮助他们享受幸福和快乐。", "In a nutshell, **as a youngster, I deem that it is advisable for** parents **to** accompany their children and communicate more with them, which **can bring kids** warmth, **inspire their passion for** life, **and help them** enjoy happiness and delight. (195 words)", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["06 图画：“陪着”不等于“陪伴”｜相关表达（10）", "1. 陪伴　accompany\n2. 阻碍孩子的成长　hinder children’s growth\n3. 改善亲子关系　improve the parent-children relationship\n4. 抚养孩子　foster/raise/bring up a child\n5. 溺爱孩子　dote on one’s child\n6. 榜样　role model\n7. 树立榜样　set an example\n8. 代沟　generation gap\n9. 和谐的关系　a harmonious relationship\n10. 关注孩子的心理需求　pay attention to the psychological needs of children", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["智能手机能让我们与他人建立良好关系，使生活更便捷，但过度使用智能手机可能会影响亲子互动。", "Smartphones can be a way to connect with others and make our lives easier, but their overuse can interfere with parent-child interactions.", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["倾听有助于父母和孩子建立更深厚的情感联结和更亲密的关系。", "Listening helps parents and children form stronger bonds and relationships.", "大作文 · Topic 06"],
  ["07 图画：热门vs热爱｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the pictures below. In your\nessay, you should\n(1) describe the pictures briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕左格：女孩背着书包，望着写有“热门新兴岗位”的招聘牌，心里想“这个专业需求旺盛，前景广阔！”；右格：女孩对男孩说“我十分热爱这个专业。”；下方标注：热门 vs热爱", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["07 图画：热门vs热爱｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n文字描述+图画细节1+图画细节2\n**中间段（4~8句话）**\n图画联系主旨+普遍现象+原因+观点+建议+积极意义+举例\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n建议1+建议2", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["07 图画：热门vs热爱｜词汇（10）", "1. passionate *adj.* 热诚的，狂热的\n2. emerging *adj.* 新兴的\n3. prospect *n.* 前景\n4. factor *n.* 因素\n5. security *n.* 担保，保证\n6. promising *adj.* 有前途的，有希望的\n7. recipient *n.* 接受方\n8. originate from 源于，起源于\n9. self-assessment *n.* 自我评估\n10. identify *v.* 找到，发现", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["首先，我们能注意到图画下方有几个汉字，写的是“热门vs热爱”。左图中，一个年轻人关注着新兴领域的热门专业，心里想着：“这个专业需求旺盛，前景广阔！”右图显示，一个女孩选择某个专业是出于对它的热爱。", "First of all, **several Chinese characters can be noticed below the pictures, which read \"Popularity or Passion\"**. In the left picture, a youngster focuses on popular majors in emerging fields, **with** a thought in his mind, \"This major is in high demand and has broad prospects!\" The right picture shows that a girl chooses a major because she is passionate about it.", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["显然，这样的场景能让人联想到可能影响年轻人选择未来专业的各种因素。不可否认，在现实生活中，大多数年轻人倾向于选择热门专业，如人工智能、经济学或金融学。正是这些专业使他们毕业后能够拥有更好的就业机会、更稳固的就业保障和更高的薪资。然而，在我看来，热爱可以比作一把打开长期成功之门的钥匙。我们应该选择自己热爱的专业，这能够带给我们巨大的动力，激发我们奋斗的热情，并帮助我们创造光明的未来。王虹就是一个典型的例子。作为2026年菲尔兹奖得主之一，她认为自己的成功源于对数学的热爱。", "**Such scenarios, apparently, can be associated with** various factors that may affect youngsters' choices of future majors. **Admittedly, in reality, a majority of young people tend to opt for popular majors, such as** AI, economics or finance. **It is these majors that enable them to** enjoy better job opportunities, greater job security and higher salaries after graduation. However, **to my mind, passion can be likened to** a key which unlocks the gate of long-term success. **It is advisable for** us **to** choose what we love, **which can bring us** tremendous motivation, **inspire our enthusiasm for striving, and help us** create a promising future. Hong Wang is a case in point. As one of the recipients of the 2026 Fields Medal, **she deems that** her success originates from her love for mathematics.", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["简而言之，年轻人选择专业时，首先应该向内求索。对他们来说，很有必要在盲目跟风之前先进行自我评估，找到自己真正的兴趣。", "In a nutshell, when choosing a major, young people are **supposed to** look inward first. **It is exceedingly necessary for them to** conduct self-assessments to identify their true interests before following trends blindly. (226 words)", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["07 图画：热门vs热爱｜相关表达（10）", "1. 热门/新兴专业　popular/emerging majors\n2. 就业前景　job/career prospects\n3. 需求旺盛　be in high demand\n4. 发挥个人优势　play to one's strengths\n5. 个人兴趣　personal interests\n6. 长期目标　long-term goals\n7. 职业规划　career planning\n8. 进行自我评估　conduct a self-assessment\n9. 兼顾兴趣与就业前景　balance interests with career prospects\n10. 避免盲目跟风　avoid following trends blindly", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["要想选到合适的专业，既要考虑当下的兴趣，也要顾及未来的职业目标。", "To choose the right major, keep in mind both your present interests and your future career goals.", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["没有任何一个专业能够保证固定的职业道路或收入水平。", "No single major guarantees a set career path or income level.", "大作文 · Topic 07"],
  ["08 图画：举手之劳｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the picture below. In your essay,\nyou should\n(1) describe the picture briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕长椅上坐着一名青年，说“这是清洁工的事。”；另一人弯腰捡起地上的饮料瓶，旁边立着垃圾桶；下方标注：举手之劳", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["08 图画：举手之劳｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图画+图画细节1+图画细节2+文字说明\n**中间段（4~8句话）**\n图画联系主旨+个人观点+现实情况+值得关注+原因+积极意义\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n号召", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["08 图画：举手之劳｜词汇（9）", "1. bend *v.* 俯身，弯腰\n2. garbage man （清运垃圾的）清洁工人\n3. maintain *v.* 维护\n4. bench *n.* （多指木制）长凳，长椅\n5. take on 承担（责任）\n6. litter *n.* （在公共场所乱扔的）垃圾，废弃物\n7. shared *adj.* 共有的，共同的\n8. deed *n.* 行为，行动\n9. obligation *n.* 义务，责任", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["这是一幅简单但具有启发性的漫画，漫画中，有个年轻人正弯腰捡地上的一个瓶子。但另一个年轻人却让他把瓶子留在那儿，因为这是清洁工的工作。最后，我们能注意到图画下方有几个汉字，写的是“举手之劳”。", "**This is a simple but enlightening cartoon**, in which **there is a** youngster, **bending** over to pick up a bottle on the ground. However, the other young guy tells him to leave it there since this is the garbage man's job. **Several Chinese characters, finally, can be noticed below the picture, which say** \"It is just a simple action.\"", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["显然，上述场景能让人联想到对待社会责任感的两种截然不同的态度。作为一个年轻人，我坚信每个公民都应该维护和保护环境。然而，在现实生活中，很多人就像图中坐在长椅上的男孩一样，不愿意承担任何社会责任，例如捡起垃圾。这种现象非常值得关注，因为地球可以比作我们共同的家园，它需要我们的关心和爱护。同时，我们需要一个干净、舒适的环境，这会带给我们健康，激发我们对生活的热爱，并帮助我们创造美好的未来。", "**Such a scenario, apparently, can be associated with** two distinct attitudes towards social responsibilities. As a young man, **I cling to the idea that it is advisable for** every citizen **to** maintain and protect the environment. **However, in reality, a host of people,** just like the boy sitting on the bench in the picture, are unwilling to take on any amount of social duty, **such as** picking up the litter. **This phenomenon is particularly worth attention for the reason that the earth can be likened to** our shared homeland which requires our care and love. Meanwhile, we need a clean and comfortable environment, **which can bring us** health, **inspire our passion for life, and help us** create a promising future.", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["因此，整个社会应营造一种积极的氛围，来鼓励居民在日常生活中做好事，并批评那些拒绝承担任何社会责任的人。", "Accordingly, **society as a whole should foster a positive atmosphere to** encourage residents to do good deeds in daily life and criticize those who refuse to shoulder any social obligation. (209 words)", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["08 图画：举手之劳｜相关表达（9）", "1. 举手之劳　it's just a simple action\n2. 乱扔垃圾　drop litter\n3. 承担社会责任　take on/shoulder/undertake social responsibility/duty/obligation\n4. 美德　virtue/merit\n5. 只考虑自己的利益　for one's own benefit; self-interested\n6. 保护环境　protect the environment\n7. 改善生活环境　improve the living environment\n8. 共同的努力　shared efforts\n9. 不当/不文明行为　inappropriate/uncivilized behavior", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["个体的努力能积少成多，汇聚成集体的力量。", "Individual efforts can accumulate and merge into a collective force.", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["通过用自己的努力来改善他人的生活，你会收获真正有价值、美妙无比的东西。", "By using your effort to improve the lives of others, you can achieve truly valuable and wonderful things.", "大作文 · Topic 08"],
  ["09 图画：中国传统艺术的传承｜题目", "**Directions:**\nWrite an essay based on the pictures below. In your\nessay, you should\n(1) describe the pictures briefly,\n(2) interpret the implied meaning, and\n(3) give your comments.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\n〔图〕左图老工匠捧云纹图本向青年讲解，右图青年举云纹图纸向同龄人展示；图下文字：“中国传统艺术的传承”", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["09 图画：中国传统艺术的传承｜结构", "**首段（3~4句话）**\n概述图画+图画细节1+图画细节2\n**中间段（4~8句话）**\n典型特征+普遍现象+值得关注+个人观点+建议1+建议2+积极意义\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n号召+建议+积极意义", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["09 图画：中国传统艺术的传承｜词汇（14）", "1. inspiring *adj.* 鼓舞人心的，激励的\n2. pass down 使世代相传，流传\n3. revitalize *v.* 使恢复生机（或健康）\n4. craftsman *n.* 工匠，手艺人\n5. intangible *adj.* （资产，利益）无形的\n6. heritage *n.* 遗产（指国家或社会长期形成的历史、传统和特色）\n7. take the initiative to do sth. 主动做某事\n8. inherit *v.* 继承（金钱、财产等）\n9. preserve *v.* 保护，保留\n10. audience *n.* 观众，听众\n11. fusion *n.* 融合，结合\n12. splendid *adj.* 雄伟的，壮丽的\n13. static *adj.* 静止的，静态的\n14. workshop *n.* 研讨会，讲习班", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["这两幅图画简单却鼓舞人心，展示出中国传统艺术可以由年轻一代传承并焕发新的活力。具体来看，左图中有一位年长的工匠，手里拿着画有中国传统云纹图案的本子，正在认真向一名年轻人传授相关知识。而在右图中，这名年轻人自信地向同龄人展示这个云纹的设计，引起了他们极大的兴趣。", "**These are two simple but quite inspiring drawings, which illustrate** that traditional Chinese art can be passed down and revitalized by younger generations. To be specific, in the left one, **there is** an elderly craftsman, **with** a traditional Chinese cloud pattern on his book, carefully **imparting** related knowledge to a youngster. Then, in the right picture, the young man confidently presents the cloud design to his peers, arousing their great interest.", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["作为文明古国，中国的突出特点就是拥有丰富的非物质文化遗产。然而，不可否认的是，随着老一辈人的离世，一些珍贵的传统技艺有失传的趋势。这一现象尤其值得关注。我认为，年轻一代可以比作连接过去与未来的重要桥梁。因此，我们应该主动投身于文化遗产的传承。此外，我们不仅应保护这些传统，还应通过现代平台或人工智能技术把它们推广给更多的受众。正是古老智慧与现代技术的融合，使我们灿烂的文化得以继续蓬勃发展，而不是变成博物馆里静止的展品。", "China, as an ancient civilization, **is characterized by** its rich intangible cultural heritage. However, admittedly, certain valuable traditional skills tend to be lost as older generations pass away. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention. I deem that** younger generations **can be likened to** vital bridges which link the past with the future. Thus, we **are supposed to** take the initiative to inherit our cultural heritage. In addition, **it is advisable for** us not only to preserve these traditions, but also **to** introduce them to a wider audience through modern platforms or AI technologies. **It is** the fusion of ancient wisdom and modern technology **that enables** our splendid culture **to** continue to thrive rather than become a static museum exhibit.", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["总而言之，每个人都应牢记，传统文化和艺术是我们文明的根基。因此，学校和社区很有必要组织研讨会，让老一辈向年轻人传授传统技艺。这将给我们带来学习文化遗产的机会，激发我们传播它们的热情，并帮助我们将其传承给后世。", "In the final analysis, **everyone should bear in mind that** traditional culture and art are the roots of our civilization. Thus, **it is exceedingly necessary for** schools and communities **to** organize workshops where seniors can teach traditional crafts to young people. This **will give** us opportunities to learn about our cultural heritage, **inspire our passion for** spreading it, **and help us** pass it down to future generations. (257 words)", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["09 图画：中国传统艺术的传承｜相关表达（10）", "1. 非物质文化遗产　intangible cultural heritage\n2. 文化瑰宝　cultural treasure\n3. 民间艺术　folk art\n4. 传统技艺　traditional skills/crafts\n5. 历史悠久的传统　a long-standing/time-honored tradition\n6. 弘扬传统文化　promote/foster traditional culture\n7. 将某物代代相传　hand sth. down from generation to generation\n8. 文化认同/意识　cultural identity/awareness\n9. 文化融合　cultural blending/integration/fusion\n10. 让传统焕发新活力　revitalize tradition; breathe new life into tradition", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["年轻创作者正拥抱传统手工技艺，从木雕到锻造皆是如此。", "Young makers are embracing traditional craft techniques, from wood carving to forging.", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["如今，我们的手艺人传承着刺绣这一文化遗产，在尊重传统的同时改良这些精美的手工艺品以适应现代的生活。", "Today, our artisans carry on the embroidery heritage, respecting the tradition while adapting these exquisite handicrafts for contemporary life.", "大作文 · Topic 09"],
  ["10 材料作文：奖励式教育（新大纲）｜题目", "**Directions:**\nRead the following excerpt from an article and write\nan essay. In your essay, you should explain whether or\nto what extent you agree with the author. Support your\nargument with reasons and relevant examples.\nWrite your answer in 160-200 words on the ANSWER\nSHEET. (20 points)\nMany parents look for some sort of reward system that\nmight help improve their children's behaviors at home.\nWhile this incentive-based parenting can be a quick fix,\nresearch clearly indicates that it can become a problem\nover time. One problem is that children often do not\ndevelop an internal motivation needed to maintain\nbehaviors when the reward is not being offered. For\nexample, if you reward your children every time they\nreceive an “A” on a test, their desire to learn will depend\non whether there is a prize. As a result, it becomes very\ndifficult for them to develop interest in learning itself,\nand the internal motivation to learn.", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 材料作文：奖励式教育（新大纲）｜题目解读", "许多父母都在寻找某种可能有助于改善孩子居家表现的奖励机制。尽管这种奖励式养育可作应急之用，但研究表明，随着时间的推移，可能会引发问题。一个问题是，当没有奖励时，孩子们通常无法形成保持行为所需的内在动力。例如，如果每当你的孩子在考试中得了 A，你就奖励他们，那么他们学习的动力将取决于有无奖励。这样一来，他们就很难培养对学习本身的兴趣和形成学习的内在动力。\n\n本题属于材料作文，2027年新大纲给出了相关样题，要求考生针对一段阅读材料进行写作，此前从未考查过。即使今年考查到，大家也不必担心，前面图画作文中的很多功能句同样适用。对于此类题目，大家在写作时可先在第一段对节选内容进行概述，进而表明自己的观点（同意或反对），然后在第二段进行论证（陈述原因、举例说明），最后进行总结即可。", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 材料作文：奖励式教育（新大纲）｜结构", "**首段（2~3句话）**\n概述材料+引出观点\n**中间段（5~6句话）**\n个人观点+举例+现实情况+值得关注+原因+危害\n**尾段（1~3句话）**\n号召+建议", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 材料作文：奖励式教育（新大纲）｜词汇（11）", "1. excerpt *n.* 摘录，节选\n2. incentive *n.* 激励，鼓励\n3. parenting *n.* 养育，抚养\n4. effective *adj.* 有效的\n5. internal *adj.* 内部的，里面的\n6. inner *adj.* 内心的\n7. competence *n.* 能力\n8. short-sighted *adj.* 目光短浅的\n9. reward *n.* 奖励\n10. unavailable *adj.* 得不到的\n11. sustainable *adj.* 可持续的", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["这是一段简单但具有启发性的文章节选，作者在文中指出，短期来看，这种奖励式教育在家里是有效的，但从长远来看会引发问题。虽然我没有孩子，但我完全同意。", "**This is a simple but enlightening excerpt of an article, in which the author argues that** incentive-based parenting can be effective at home for the short term, but will become a problem in the long run. **Although** I have no children, I couldn't agree more with it.", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["在我看来，一个人的内在动力可以比作通往成功的钥匙。一个典型的例子就是我自己。作为一名正在准备全国研究生入学考试的大四学生，我坚信正是内在动力让我可以每天刻苦学习，积累足够的知识和能力来实现梦想。然而，在现实生活中，许多目光短浅的父母可能只依靠所谓的奖励机制来鼓励孩子。这种现象特别值得关注，因为如果没有奖励，孩子们往往无法保持积极的行为。也就是说，从长远来看，这种奖励机制可能会构成一种障碍，阻碍年轻人的成长和进步。", "**To my understanding,** one's internal motivation **can be likened to** the key to success. **A case in point** is myself. As a senior who is preparing for the national entrance exams for postgraduate studies, **I cling to the idea that it is** inner motivation **that enables me to** work hard each day, and accumulate adequate knowledge and competence to achieve my dream. **However, in reality, a host of short-sighted parents** may merely rely on the so-called reward system to encourage their children. This phenomenon **is particularly worth attention for the reason that** children often fail to maintain positive behaviors if the reward is unavailable. That is to say, in the long term, this sort of reward system **may constitute an obstacle that hinders** youngsters' growth and progress.", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["因此，所有家长都应牢记，内在动力培养的是对学习本身的兴趣。如果父母想看到孩子不断成长，就应该激发孩子的内在动力。", "Accordingly, **all parents should bear in mind that** internal motivation cultivates interest in learning itself. If parents intend to see children's sustainable growth, **it is advisable for** them **to** inspire the young's internal motivation. (208 words)", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["10 材料作文：奖励式教育（新大纲）｜相关表达（8）", "1. 在我看来　to my understanding; from my point of view\n2. 从长远来看　in the long run/term\n3. 从短期来看　in the short run/term\n4. 我完全同意……　I fully/totally agree with ...\n5. 我部分同意……　I partly agree with ...\n6. 我强烈反对……　I strongly disapprove of ...\n7. ……毋庸置疑　There is no doubt that ...\n8. 作者在选段中指出……　In the excerpt, the author argues/points out that ...", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["主动学习比被动学习更有效。", "Learning is more effective when it is an active rather than a passive process.", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
  ["如果你不愿意学习，没有人能帮助你。如果你下定决心要学习，没有人能阻止你。", "If you're not willing to learn, no one can help you. If you're determined to learn, no one can stop you.", "大作文 · Topic 10"],
];
